          "summary": "ci-guards runs the real test step on scratch copies and requires a refusal with intact sentinels.",
          "rationale": "The D1 regression deleted both checkout and git sentinels on 2e4a1b2. The fixed head refuses six path forms, including a symlink alias and /. A find shim confines deletion to scratch even when testing vulnerable revisions. Both CI platforms run these guards through the existing canary-guards step. Real Go coverage was checked separately by full scripts/ci.",
